n interfere  except himself because he is in charge  so if James Gunn wanted Chris Pratt to  play Batman he could make it happen no  one would stand in his way no one can  stand in his way but James Gunn I think  is being very smart about this entire  thing I think he's got a real great plan  that he said he is going to reveal this  month now in this plan I don't think  we're going to hear anything about any  of the cast members for Guardians of the  Galaxy joining the DC Universe this is  probably a little bit down the line for  example James Gunn has already stated  that he's basically doing a reboot of  the DC Universe talking about how we're  going to have a new Superman movie with  a new Superman who is going to be a  younger Superman so we can assume that  most of these new characters which are  really old characters coming into the  rebooted Universe like Wonder Woman  Batman Aquaman cyborg The Flash although  we have no idea what's going on with  Ezra Miller at DC right now but we can  assume all of these characters in the  reboot are going to be younger  characters so we can assume that Chris  Pratt and the cast of the Guardians  aren't going to be playing any of these  characters I don't think Zoe Saldana is  going to be Wonder Woman and I don't  think that Chris Pratt is going to be  playing Superman however there are some  really cool DC characters that these  actors could play like Lex Luthor  Darkseid Martian Manhunter a new Riddler  a new Joker these are all characters  that are going to be coming to the new  DCU then of course we have characters  like Black Canary Selena Kyle AKA  Catwoman and I actually wouldn't mind  Chris Pratt playing somebody really  really awesome like Deathstroke see a  different side of Chris Pratt the point  is there is many many different awesome  characters that these cast members could  play over at DC the question is who is  going to be a perfect fit for them so  right away if you have anybody in mind  any role in mind f